WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:05.320
Welcome to Module 5 of Global Secure
Access as the Identity-Aware Network:

2
00:00:05.320 --> 00:00:07.912
Internet Access and T L S inspection.

3
00:00:07.912 --> 00:00:12.587
Internet Access is the identity-aware
web gateway for remote users.

4
00:00:12.587 --> 00:00:16.329
T L S inspection comes last of
all, because it's the step most

5
00:00:16.329 --> 00:00:20.850
likely to break applications and to
read content the agency shouldn't.

6
00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:26.403
This module covers Steps 5 and 9 of the
Global Secure Access implementation guide,

7
00:00:26.403 --> 00:00:30.720
and takes about fifty minutes, plus
a lab in your own test tenant.
